#: ckanext/schemingdcat/templates/schemingdcat/endpoints/index.html:24
msgid ""
"This endpoint allows access to geographic metadata in accordance with the "
"INSPIRE regulations, through the CSW (Catalog Service for the Web) standard."
msgstr ""
"Este punto final permite el acceso a metadatos geográficos de acuerdo con la"
" normativa INSPIRE, a través del estándar CSW (Catalog Service for the Web)."

#: ckanext/schemingdcat/templates/schemingdcat/endpoints/index.html:25
